<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-indigo-round-cap.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#535076"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-green-wide-headphones.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#535076"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-rose-dots-flower.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#535076"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 4px 0px 0px"><img src="https://x.test/email/agent-amber-round-antenna.png" width="36" height="46" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:36px;height:46px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:#535076"></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#12102b">Crie o <span style="display:inline-block">seu workspace</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2b284d">Agora você pode criar o seu workspace no squadchat com <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#12102b">rafa@ estudio. design</b>, a conta que você <span style="display:inline-block">já tem.</span></p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/onboarding" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#12102b;border:1px solid #12102b;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#f6f6fb;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#12102b"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#f6f6fb">Criar meu workspace</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#535076">O botão não funcionou? Copie e cole este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">no navegador:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/onboarding" target="_blank" style="color:#535076;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dddde1;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/onboarding</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#635f87">Você recebeu este e-mail porque esta conta ganhou acesso antecipado <span style="display:inline-block">ao squadchat.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#635f87">Enviado pelo servidor do squadchat <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
