</tr></table></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#12102b">Your agents&#39; computer <span style="display:inline-block">is ready</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2b284d">Thanks for waiting. <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#12102b">Souza Bakery</b>&#39;s computer is on and set up, with a user of its own for each agent. It stays on day and night, so your agents can work <span style="display:inline-block">any time.</span></p>
<table width="100%" class="well" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#e9e8f4;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td style="padding:4px 16px">
<table width="100%" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td class="mu" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#535076">CPUs</td>
<td class="ink" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#12102b;text-align:right">4</td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #d7d6e4;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#535076">Memory</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #d7d6e4;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#12102b;text-align:right">8 GB</td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #d7d6e4;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#535076">Disk</td>
