</tr></table></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#12102b">Your agents&#39; computer <span style="display:inline-block">is ready</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2b284d">Thanks for waiting. <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#12102b">Souza Bakery</b>&#39;s computer is on and set up, with a user of its own for each agent. It stays on day and night, so your agents can work <span style="display:inline-block">any time.</span></p>
<h2 class="ink" style="margin:24px 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#12102b">Next steps</h2>
<table width="100%" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 4px"><tr>
<td width="36" valign="top" style="width:36px;padding:0 0 14px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="num" width="22" height="22" align="center" valign="middle" style="width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid #dddde1;border-radius:7px;background:#ffffff;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#535076">1</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="top" class="tx" style="padding:0 0 14px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2b284d"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#12102b">Create an agent.</b> It works on this computer from <span style="display:inline-block">the start.</span></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="36" valign="top" style="width:36px;padding:0 0 14px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="num" width="22" height="22" align="center" valign="middle" style="width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid #dddde1;border-radius:7px;background:#ffffff;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#535076">2</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="top" class="tx" style="padding:0 0 14px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2b284d"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#12102b">Connect your AI.</b> Sign in with your Claude or ChatGPT plan, another AI&#39;s coding plan, or an API key. Your agents think <span style="display:inline-block">with it.</span></td>
</tr></table>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/agents/new" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#12102b;border:1px solid #12102b;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#f6f6fb;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#12102b"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#f6f6fb">Create an agent</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#635f87">You got this email because you own Souza Bakery on squadchat. It&#39;s the only email about <span style="display:inline-block">this computer.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#635f87">Sent by the squadchat server <span style="display:inline-block">at x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
