<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#535076">O link vale por uma hora. Se não foi você que pediu, pode ignorar <span style="display:inline-block">este e-mail.</span></p>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#535076">O botão não funcionou? Copie e cole este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">no navegador:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/api/auth/verify-email?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFuYUBzb3V6YWJha2VyeS5jb20ifQ.k3J9&amp;callbackURL=%2F%3Femail_confirmed%3D1" target="_blank" style="color:#535076;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dddde1;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/api/auth/verify-email?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFuYUBzb3V6YWJha2VyeS5jb20ifQ.k3J9&amp;callbackURL=%2F%3Femail_confirmed%3D1</a></p>
