<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#535076">Se foi você, não precisa <span style="display:inline-block">fazer nada.</span></p>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#535076">O botão não funcionou? Copie e cole este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">no navegador:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/email-undo?token=Hk2dQ9xWm4Lp7Rt1Vb8Nc3Zs6Yf0Ja5Ue" target="_blank" style="color:#535076;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dddde1;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/email-undo?token=Hk2dQ9xWm4Lp7Rt1Vb8Nc3Zs6Yf0Ja5Ue</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
