<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#535076">If it wasn&#39;t you, write <span style="display:inline-block">to <a class="ln-m" href="mailto:help@agentes.chat" style="color:#535076;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dddde1;text-underline-offset:3px">help@agentes.chat</a>.</span></p>
