<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Carlos Souza</b> mudou quem pode usar a sua conta do Claude <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Trabalho</b>. O que fizerem com ela usa o seu plano e os <span style="display:inline-block">limites dele.</span></p>
<table width="100%" class="well" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f3f3f0;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td style="padding:4px 16px">
