</tr></table></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">Para desfazer, abra a conta em IA e uso e mude as <span style="display:inline-block">permissões dela.</span></p>
